[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0010","text":"──────在这种地方待机……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0020","text":"……美琴小姐，那边不冷吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0030","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0040","text":"我再让人送点暖宝宝过来吧……！\n给制作人发个联────……阿嚏！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0050","text":"……再靠过来一点？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0060","text":"────诶，那个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0070","text":"………………真的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0080","text":"是挺冷的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0090","text":"是、是的是的，很冷……！\n……不过──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_03_0100","text":"────靠过来之后……\n好像就暖和了"}]
